    "dgf_testimonial_f9eLmm": {
      "type": "dgf-testimonial",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_BrXRPm": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>This product has helped me so much with my overall health. My hot flashes are so much better. Thank you!</p>",
            "author_name": "- Christy Brown"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_MpVh4z": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>I’ve been taking Tribe Ashwagandha KSM-66 for about a month now. It has definitely lowered my day to day stress levels and improved my quality of sleep. Also, I’ve no detrimental side affects. 100% definitely recommend if you experience elevated stress levels.</p>",
            "author_name": "- Shawn"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_A9AeQw": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>Oh my, I have energy now.<br/>I had gotten to the point where I literally was so exhausted it was hard to put one foot in front of the other. My personality is such I think my cortisol has always been elevated, hence exhausted adrenals. I have been taking this product for several weeks and feel so much better. I am amazed at how much better I feel and how much energy I have now, I am actually getting things done for a change. Thank you so much for this product.</p>",
            "author_name": "- Linda"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_JUk3jw": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>good price point and better than other ashwagandha supplements<br/>This is an affordable price for a good-quality product. It works better than other ashwagandha supplements I have used in the past. I'll order again.</p>",
            "author_name": "- Jennifer Cerny"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_88qjkH": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>Most Amazing Ashwaganda<br/>I love this product so much. It has been vital to me, helping me manage, and lowering anxiety and stress, I feel more chill and relaxed while I am also quite active throughout my day.<br/>Thank you!</p>",
            "author_name": "- Daniela Aragón Pinto"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_ej36bt": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>I think it help with sleep. I work 3pm-2:00am usually get to bed by 4:am and try to be up by 12pm and i was have issues sleeping through alarms a waking up tired, consistent use of this sup has me waking up easier at 12pm feeling pretty good. also it had been months since I had any dreams, now its been almost nightly.\t\t\t</p>",
            "author_name": "- Mickey"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_WYdYjE": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
