        "section_title": "<h2>Meet ASHWAGANDHA KSM-66: Nature's most powerful adaptogen</h2>",
        "section_subtitle": "<p>For over 5,000 years, Ashwagandha (<i>Withania somnifera</i>) has been revered in Ayurvedic medicine as the “Prince of Herbs.” Traditionally used to restore balance to the nervous system, it was prescribed to calm the mind, build strength and resilience, and promote deep, restorative sleep.\n<br><br>\nIts Sanskrit name, meaning “the strength of a horse,” symbolizes the vitality, stamina, and grounding energy it brings to both body and mind. Today, modern clinical research confirms what ancient healers understood: Ashwagandha helps regulate cortisol, supports nervous system balance, enhances energy and focus, and promotes optimal hormonal and sleep health — making it one of the most effective natural tools for managing stress, fatigue, and restless nights.</p>",
        "left_image": "shopify://shop_images/255536280_1410159149398756_1363022821583506383_n_1.webp",
